Z||000012||Archie||06-15-2001||10:46 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by AusFiero:<BR><B> </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Wow, cool..... I ask for a few suggestions and you go and "Paint" a bunch of them for me. Thank You Very Much!<P>Several of those colors look great. Now I gotta build about 5 more Finos to evaluate in real life all the good "Cyber-painting" you did.<P>I wish I could do that re-coloring thing, it would be a great help at my place.<P>I only saw one person recommend Silver and that was the color I was leaning towards.<P>From what I'm seeing so far I may have to re-evaluate my color choices.<P>Thanks to this thread, I'll be able to show my advisors what the various colors would look like on Monday.<P>Thanks Again.<P>And keep the suggestions coming.<P>Archie<P>||||reg||1
